  "description": "<h2 data-start=\"182\" data-end=\"207\">Product Description:</h2>\n<p data-start=\"208\" data-end=\"478\">Our <strong data-start=\"212\" data-end=\"238\">wicker storage baskets</strong> are handcrafted in Vietnam using natural, eco-friendly wicker, woven by skilled artisans from traditional craft villages. Each basket is durable, lightweight, and designed to bring both functionality and rustic charm to any living space.</p>\n<p data-start=\"480\" data-end=\"817\">Perfect for organizing clothes, toys, magazines, or home essentials, these baskets add a natural aesthetic to homes, hotels, restaurants, and retail shops. With custom sizes and finishes available, our wicker baskets are a sustainable alternative to plastic storage, making them an ideal choice for importers and wholesalers worldwide.</p>\n<p data-start=\"819\" data-end=\"1029\">By working with us, you are supporting Vietnam’s rural communities, helping farmers earn additional income during their free time, while preserving cultural heritage and creating export value for the country.</p>\n<p data-start=\"1031\" data-end=\"1260\"><strong data-start=\"1031\" data-end=\"1070\">Supplier &amp; Manufacturer in Vietnam:</strong><br data-start=\"1070\" data-end=\"1073\" />We provide high-quality wicker storage baskets with bulk and wholesale options for retailers, decorators, and importers. For inquiries, please contact us at <strong data-start=\"1230\" data-end=\"1257\"><a class=\"decorated-link cursor-pointer\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"1232\" data-end=\"1255\">vietcraft2006@gmail.com</a></strong>.</p>\n<h2 data-start=\"1262\" data-end=\"1280\">Key Features:</h2>\n<ul data-start=\"1281\" data-end=\"1603\">\n<li data-start=\"1281\" data-end=\"1344\">\n<p data-start=\"1283\" data-end=\"1344\">Material: 100% natural wicker, eco-friendly and sustainable</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1345\" data-end=\"1388\">\n<p data-start=\"1347\" data-end=\"1388\">Handmade by skilled Vietnamese artisans</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1389\" data-end=\"1430\">\n<p data-start=\"1391\" data-end=\"1430\">Sturdy, lightweight, and long-lasting</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1431\" data-end=\"1496\">\n<p data-start=\"1433\" data-end=\"1496\">Multipurpose: clothing, toys, books, kitchen items, and décor</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1497\" data-end=\"1559\">\n<p data-start=\"1499\" data-end=\"1559\">Custom sizes, shapes, and finishes available for wholesale</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1560\" data-end=\"1603\">\n<p data-start=\"1562\" data-end=\"1603\">Perfect for home, hotel, and retail use</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"1629\" data-end=\"1778\">\n<p data-start=\"1959\" data-end=\"2102\">",
